CORE
main.cpp
--cpp11
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ enumeration to pointer: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ invalid handle: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
reinterpret_cast from an enumeration type to a pointer was rejected ("type
mismatch on reinterpret_cast").  The MSVC STL's <filesystem>
(__std_fs_file_handle, xfilesystem_abi.h) converts handles this way.
